---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  titleOverride="Commercial Construction Company in Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="VP Infra is a trusted commercial construction company in Lucknow delivering offices, retail spaces & industrial projects on time. ISO certified. Call 8840069902."
>
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82)), url('/images/commercial_construction_lucknow.webp');">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fade-in-up">Commercial Construction Company in Lucknow</h1>
      <p class="fade-in-up mt-4">Office buildings, retail centres, and industrial facilities — built to last and built to perform.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-details">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
        <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Commercial Construction Built for Business Outcomes</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">A commercial building is not just a structure. It is a business asset. Every design decision affects occupancy, utility costs, rental yield, and the impression it makes on clients who walk through the door. VP Infra approaches commercial construction in Lucknow with that business lens. We are not just building walls and a roof.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">Our ISO 9001:2015 certified process ensures commercial projects meet structural safety codes, fire safety norms, and local municipal regulations from the planning stage. We have completed office complexes, retail spaces, showrooms, warehouses, and mixed-use commercial buildings across Lucknow's primary commercial corridors.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Types of Commercial Projects We Handle</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Office Buildings:</strong> G+2 to G+5 commercial office structures with lift provisions, fire escape staircases, and dedicated parking, designed to BIS structural codes.</li>
            <li><strong>Retail Showrooms and Shop Complexes:</strong> Ground floor commercial units with large window frontage, high ceiling, and strong electrical load infrastructure.</li>
            <li><strong>Warehouses and Industrial Sheds:</strong> RCC or pre-engineered steel structures with wide-span roofs, heavy-duty flooring, and dock-level loading provisions.</li>
            <li><strong>Mixed-Use Buildings:</strong> Ground and first floor commercial with residential floors above, for investors wanting both rental income streams from one plot.</li>
            <li><strong>Institutional Buildings:</strong> School buildings, coaching institute premises, and small clinic structures with compliance for the relevant occupancy classification.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Key Technical Standards We Follow</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>IS 456:2000:</strong> Plain and reinforced concrete code for all commercial RCC structures.</li>
            <li><strong>NBC 2016:</strong> National Building Code compliance covering fire safety, life safety, and structural design.</li>
            <li><strong>IS 1893:2016:</strong> Seismic design for structures in Lucknow's Zone II/III classification.</li>
            <li><strong>LMC / LDA Building Byelaws:</strong> Full compliance with local setback, height, FAR, and parking requirements.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="internal-links-section mt-8">
            <p>Also explore our other construction services:</p>
            <ul class="related-links">
              <li><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/residential-construction-services-in-lucknow/">Residential construction services in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/turnkey-building-contractors-in-lucknow/">Turnkey building contractors in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/duplex-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Duplex construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/custom-home-builders-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">Custom home builders in Ashiyana, Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/">About VP Infra</a></li>
              <li><a href="/contact-us/">Contact us for a quote</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8"><a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary">Discuss Your Commercial Project</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <img src="/images/commercial_construction_lucknow.webp" alt="Commercial Construction Company in Lucknow — VP Infra team at commercial building site" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Everything You Need to Know -->
  <section class="know-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="know-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need to Know</h2>
        <p class="know-subtitle">Key facts about commercial construction in Lucknow — permits, timelines, codes, and what separates commercial builds from residential.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="know-stats">
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">14–20</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Months, G+2 building</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">NBC</span><span class="know-stat-desc">2016 Code compliant</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">ISO</span><span class="know-stat-desc">9001:2015 Certified</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">Fire</span><span class="know-stat-desc">NOC managed by us</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="know-grid">
        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">📋</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Permits and Approvals</h3>
            <p>Commercial buildings in Lucknow require building plan approval from LMC or LDA depending on the plot's zone. For buildings exceeding 15 metres in height, a fire NOC from the UP Fire Services Department is mandatory before occupation. Projects near airport boundaries require AAI height clearance. VP Infra manages the complete multi-authority approval process for commercial clients.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🗓️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Construction Timelines</h3>
            <p>A 3-storey commercial building of approximately 5,000 sq ft in Lucknow typically takes 14 to 20 months from LMC approval to handover — 3 to 4 months for approvals, 8 to 12 months for structural work, and 3 to 4 months for finishing and MEP. VP Infra provides a detailed project schedule at contract signing with monthly milestone checkpoints.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🔬</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Commercial vs Residential Standards</h3>
            <p>Commercial buildings must comply with the National Building Code for fire safety and life safety at higher structural load factors. Structural loads for office occupancy are calculated at 3 to 5 kN/m2 versus 2 kN/m2 for homes. Column sizing, beam depths, foundation design, flooring specs, and MEP systems are all heavier-grade in commercial projects.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏪</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Retail and Showroom Design</h3>
            <p>Showrooms require large clear-span floor areas with minimal internal columns, high floor-to-ceiling heights of 4.5 to 6 metres, heavy electrical load provisions for display lighting, and full-height glass frontage. VP Infra designs the structural system to deliver these requirements within the plot's FAR and setback limits without compromising structural integrity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏭</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Warehouse and Industrial Construction</h3>
            <p>For industrial construction, VP Infra uses pre-engineered steel frames or RCC depending on span requirements. Key design factors include floor loading capacity, column-free spans, natural ventilation provisions, and heavy vehicle access routes. These specifications are determined by the client's operational requirements before structural design begins.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card know-card-highlight">
          <div class="know-icon">🔥</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Fire NOC Requirements</h3>
            <p>A fire NOC from UP Fire Services is required for commercial buildings above 15 metres or with a total floor area exceeding 500 sq metres. The process involves fire safety drawings showing sprinkler locations, smoke detectors, fire extinguisher placements, and exit route widths. VP Infra prepares and submits fire NOC documentation as part of the standard <a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">building construction service in Lucknow</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What permits are required for commercial construction in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Commercial buildings in Lucknow require building plan approval from LMC or LDA depending on the zone. For buildings above 15 metres, a fire NOC from UP Fire Services is mandatory. Projects near airport zones require AAI height clearance. VP Infra manages the complete multi-authority approval process for all commercial clients.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What is the difference between commercial and residential construction?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Commercial buildings must comply with the National Building Code at higher structural load factors than residential structures. They require separate fire egress staircases, higher floor-to-ceiling heights, and heavier-grade MEP systems. Structural loads for commercial occupancy are 3 to 5 kN/m2 versus 2 kN/m2 for homes. Material specifications and approval requirements are also more complex in commercial projects.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long does commercial construction take in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A 3-storey commercial building of approximately 5,000 sq ft in Lucknow typically takes 14 to 20 months from LMC approval to handover — 3 to 4 months for approvals, 8 to 12 months for structural work, and 3 to 4 months for finishing and MEP. VP Infra provides a detailed project schedule at contract signing with monthly milestone checkpoints.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can VP Infra build a commercial building on Kanpur Road or Gomti Nagar?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. VP Infra has experience with commercial construction on Lucknow's key corridors including Kanpur Road, Gomti Nagar, Vibhuti Khand, Amar Shaheed Path, and Hazratganj adjacent areas. The approval authority varies by zone — LMC handles most inner-city areas while LDA covers peri-urban developments. VP Infra identifies the correct authority for your plot at the initial consultation.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does commercial construction in Lucknow require a fire NOC?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A fire NOC from UP Fire Services is required for commercial buildings above 15 metres or with a total floor area exceeding 500 sq metres. This applies to most commercial complexes above G+3 in Lucknow. VP Infra's consultants prepare and submit the fire NOC documentation as part of the standard approval process.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Which is the best commercial construction company in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>V.P. Infra Properties (OPC) Pvt. Ltd. is an ISO 9001:2015 certified commercial construction company in Lucknow with MSME registration and a track record of completed commercial projects. They provide integrated services covering design, approvals, structural construction, and finishing under one contract. Call 8840069902 or visit the <a href="/contact-us/">contact page</a>.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Build Your Commercial Project in Lucknow?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 mb-8">Talk to VP Infra's team. We will assess your site, understand your commercial requirements, and give you a realistic timeline and plan before you commit.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Free Commercial Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:8840069902" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Call: 8840069902</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header { background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: var(--text-light); padding: 8rem 0 6rem; }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 3.5rem; }
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; align-items: start; padding: 4rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 992px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; } }
  .service-image img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .benefits-list { list-style: none; }
  .benefits-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-gray); }
  .benefits-list li::before { content: '🏢'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
  .benefits-list strong { color: var(--secondary); }
  .related-links { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .related-links li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .related-links a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .internal-links-section { border-top: 1px solid #e0e7f0; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .internal-links-section p { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .know-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: #f4f7fb; }
  .know-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .know-subtitle { color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .know-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .know-stat { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1.4rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
  .know-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .know-stat-value { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; }
  .know-stat-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 0.2rem; text-align: center; }
  .know-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .know-stats { flex-wrap: wrap; } .know-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); flex: 1 1 45%; } }
  .know-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem; display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }
  .know-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.11); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .know-card-highlight { border-left-color: var(--secondary); background: #fffaf4; }
  .know-icon { font-size: 1.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
  .know-card-body h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
  .know-card-body p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.72; margin: 0; }
  .know-card-body a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background: #fff; }
  .faq-list { max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0e7f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .faq-item summary { padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary); list-style: none; }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem 1.2rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.75; }
  .cta-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
  .cta-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .cta-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-lg { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .btn-secondary { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; }
</style>
